# Whitelist: the build needs exactly the workspace manifests and sources.
# Everything else — target/ (huge), certs/ and data/ (SECRETS — never in a
# build context), .git, docs — stays out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
# Per-crate junk that may exist inside crates/ locally:
crates/*/target
crates/*/Cargo.lock
# NOT whitelisted on purpose: rust-toolchain.toml pins nightly for local dev
# (miri); the image builds on its own pinned stable instead.
